                      Hierachy of UI Dialogs, both Modal and Non-Modal.!


!Dialog methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'jmv 28/Feb/2025 09:53:07'!
   buildWidgets
	"Redefine as appropriate.
	At the end, do
