                        I represent a month.!


!Month methodsFor: 'squeak protocol' stamp: 'jmv 9/Apr/2010 13:45:00'!
 daysInMonth

	^ self duration days! !


!Month methodsFor: 'inquiries' stamp: 'LC 26/Jul/1998 12:50:00'!
